    "ori_intro": {
      "type": "ori-gvm-intro",
      "settings": {
        "badge_text": "",
        "heading_line_1": "",
        "heading_line_2": "",
        "band_heading": "Unleash the Full Potential of Your Ford F150 in Australia 2021 - 2026",
        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>Stop worrying about weight limits and start adventuring with absolute confidence. Offroad Industries (ORI) offers Australia’s most comprehensive, Federally Approved GVM (Gross Vehicle Mass) upgrades for the Ford F150 range—including Platinum, Lariat, XLT SWB, and LWB models with lift kits ranging from 2” to our monster 6” package with 37” tyres.</p><p>By bundling our ORI GVM Packages with GCM testing and LS16 certification, we grant your truck true \"Super-Truck\" status. The LS16 code is our secret sauce: a specific engineering modification code for Gross Combination Mass Re-rating. This ensures your truck, your gear, and your 4.5T trailer are 100% legal together, whether registered Pre-Rego (Federal) or Post-Rego (State-based).</p><p>ORI SSM approval only apply to Ford Australia Delivered vehicles, Ford F150, SWB, LWB Platinum, Lariat, XLT vehicles.</p><p><strong>* Please also note that for the F-150 Platinum, additional fitting fees will apply. The factory electric side steps extend beyond the cab and will require modification (shortening) by our workshop to accommodate the installation of fender flares.</strong></p><p><strong>*** Attention Ford F150 Platinum Owners ***</strong></p><p>Struggling to get your drive modes working? Because Forscan programming isn't supported by all workshops, ORI is now offering a dedicated ECU Module to handle the job perfectly. This elegant, plug-and-play solution ensures your F150 Platinum's drive modes function flawlessly and is available moving forward for an additional $1,499 for any GVM package.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "<p>*Please note that some workshops may apply additional discretionary administration fees to the quoted installation and engineering price. Additionally, all Post-Registration GVM upgrades will incur additional local fees. Shipping is not included in the price.</p>",
        "style": "light",
        "padding_top": 72,
        "padding_bottom": 72
      }
    },
